export const HOME_FAQ = [
  { question: 'Who is Corvioz built for?', answer: 'Corvioz is built for independent professionals—including photographers, consultants, designers, developers, and small studios—who want quotes, invoices, client records, and recorded payment status kept in one clear workflow.' },
  { question: 'Is Corvioz accounting software, or a client workflow tool?', answer: 'Corvioz is a focused client-workflow tool rather than a full accounting suite. It keeps quotes, invoices, client records, and recorded payment status connected as work moves forward.' },
  { question: 'What happens after I finish a quote?', answer: 'You can keep the Quote connected to your client record and use it as the source for the next billing step when appropriate.' },
  { question: 'Can I share documents with clients?', answer: 'You can export Quotes and Invoices as PDFs. Client Portal and quote approval are not current capabilities.' },
  { question: 'Can I keep a history of client work in Corvioz?', answer: 'Corvioz keeps client records, quotes, invoices, and recorded payment status in one workflow, giving you a clearer history of client work.' },
  { question: 'What quote and invoice options depend on my plan?', answer: 'Free includes 5 combined new Quotes and Invoices per billing cycle with branded PDF export. Starter includes 30 combined with clean PDF export. Pro includes 100 combined with clean PDF export.' },
  { question: 'Can I export quotes and invoices?', answer: 'Free includes branded PDF export. Starter and Pro include clean PDF export.' },
  { question: 'How does Corvioz handle payment status?', answer: 'Corvioz lets you record payment status in the client workflow. Paddle is used for Corvioz subscriptions.' },
  { question: 'Can Corvioz tell me what I should charge?', answer: 'No. Corvioz does not decide what you should charge. It helps keep scope, quote details, and client documents organized so you can make your own pricing decisions with clearer context.' },
  { question: 'Who owns the documents and content I add to Corvioz?', answer: 'The documents, profile assets, and portfolio content you host on Corvioz remain your property.' },
